{
  "about": "Sample answers of the Family Calendar's brief op (contract docs/specs/2026-11-22-family-calendar-3-contract.md, 'brief op') and the message Family Butler's brief should make from each. Written from the contract and the owner's ask before the prompts were reread. `expect.nothing` = the reply is exactly NOTHING_NEW (Flock posts nothing). `mentions`: each entry must appear (case-insensitive); an array entry is alternatives, any one is enough. `once`: appears at most once. `absent`: must not appear. `maxLines`: non-empty lines at most. For a live run or an eval; the tests check only that each sample is a well-formed brief answer.",
  "samples": [
    {
      "name": "empty morning: nothing to say, weather alone is no brief",
      "kind": "morning",
      "payload": { "day": "2026-11-23", "timezone": "Asia/Kolkata", "events": [], "changed": [], "new": [], "todos_due": [] },
      "expect": { "nothing": true }
    },
    {
      "name": "empty evening",
      "kind": "evening",
      "payload": { "day": "2026-11-24", "timezone": "Asia/Kolkata", "events": [], "changed": [], "new": [], "todos_due": [] },
      "expect": { "nothing": true }
    },
